[ModeTargets]
GameName=Targets
GameDescription=Destroy all the other team's targets to win.  Prevent your targets from being destroyed.

[ModeDuel]
GameName=Duel
GameDescription=NOT FULLY WORKING.  Spawn in the field with equipment and fight.  Intended to be 1 vs 1.

[ModeRace]
GameName=Race
GameDescription=NOT FULLY WORKING.  Race against friends to the finish line.

