[ModeRabbit]
GameName=Rabbit
GameDescription=Get the flag and keep it away from the other players for as long as possible.

[ModeBall]
GameName=Ball
GameDescription=Throw a ball into the enemy team's goal to score a point.  The team with the most points wins.

[TeamInfoBeagle]
localizedName=Blood Eagle

[ModeCTF]
GameName=Capture the Flag
GameDescription=Retrieve the enemy team's flag and bring it back to your team's flag stand.  Your flag must be at its stand in order to capture their flag.

[FuelCellPlacedDenominationTen]
primaryNeutralObjectiveDesc=Pickup large fuel cell

[ModeTerritories]
GameName=Territories
GameDescription=Stand near a territory to capture it.  Capture all territories on the map to win.  Capturing a territory allows you to spawn at it.

[ModeFuel]
GameName=Fuel
GameDescription=Find fuel and bring it back to your team's depot.  First team to fill up their depot wins.  You must stand underneath other depots in order to take fuel from them.  You can only carry 15 fuel cells at a time.  When you die you lose 1 fuel cell from your depot.

